{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "020hay_402_2_4_020_02_09_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:24fcf959dba8f474b2eac8e3416ddc6c794cd78861c4c9d15acbdf7ab3b14fcd",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:020hay_402_2_4_020_02_09_b:2_4_020_02_09_b:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c48259f72cdf3ccb9da3c02032823483e958d21ab5ebd7e897edd5ff366ea042",
      "text": "喂喂？\n请问是●●●●プロデューサー吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:020hay_402_2_4_020_02_09_b:2_4_020_02_09_b:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6157f1507dc7e3d30eda4370c4f3ef7a83385194c2875a5af8bb48740d306114",
      "text": "我已经确认了刚才邮件里发来的日程，\n所以特地联络您一声。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:020hay_402_2_4_020_02_09_b:2_4_020_02_09_b:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:09977c3fa36612928d25e008127b1c945d111419810a33a7d75e8911e54af558",
      "text": "当天我绝不会迟到，会按时集合的，\n请多关照。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:020hay_402_2_4_020_02_09_b:2_4_020_02_09_b:cmd-000012:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:db9c7569b3d9b0fad1be7340656d1b9ca86612019a95274eb1701c035e3ca5da",
      "text": "你这语气\n是怎么回事？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:020hay_402_2_4_020_02_09_b:2_4_020_02_09_b:cmd-000013:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e5a68f7820996a5ba9f5f3c60a3511125c2ac5e5de370edbaefa5cef9bac3843",
      "text": "总觉得\n有点奇妙呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:020hay_402_2_4_020_02_09_b:2_4_020_02_09_b:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:617135b52c753f3308a9c911d3ded5ff70bd235250fe63bd4b767c2676a4b28c",
      "text": "果然很让人在意吗？其实我现在为了入戏，\n正把所有措辞都改成敬语呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:020hay_402_2_4_020_02_09_b:2_4_020_02_09_b:cmd-000018:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9dde1491c23d41a79b6a2d00f3549624fdeba980fce271471c71f8e3c92a3002",
      "text": "因为总是不太习惯，\n所以想着平时也多练习练习。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:020hay_402_2_4_020_02_09_b:2_4_020_02_09_b:cmd-000020:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf6d6cb9a905d2e36f9801629dfed1c2a749ed0e5dd4b2b7ff37043b8e5d66f5",
      "text": "就算是见习，也改变不了是管家的事实，\n我想用得体的语言才行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:020hay_402_2_4_020_02_09_b:2_4_020_02_09_b:cmd-000022:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:65639ba1b6ac864fb1c6fe37140fd9afe6ee391d89b05b77466f8916e7dbe9a9",
      "text": "所以……咳咳。如果我的敬语说得不规范，\n还请您告诉我哦。制作人！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:020hay_402_2_4_020_02_09_b:2_4_020_02_09_b:cmd-000024:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62a3e713f13c252452c90a0003af6e8df6b7db6b60f36a41f4d1260909358f2e",
      "text": "明白了",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:020hay_402_2_4_020_02_09_b:2_4_020_02_09_b:cmd-000025:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:910e638c296c054b7ea5736cbf0a32a36bb946ac44cc15ecf379f9db381e4d43",
      "text": "请加油",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:020hay_402_2_4_020_02_09_b:2_4_020_02_09_b:cmd-000028:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43a0fd320acf22b9b5793a082636b1291f9158cc40b086fcfb83a475124f1ed0",
      "text": "非常感谢。\n那么，失陪了！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
